1. Purpose & Architecture
--------------------------------------------------------------------

session-checkpoint is a local, application-neutral session checkpoint
storage carrier with cryptographic SHA-256 integrity verification,
strict namespace isolation, bounded memory/resource allocation caps,
and reversible export/import bundles for Python applications and JSON CLI
tooling.

The package is explicitly:
  * 100% Local-First and Air-Gapped (Zero Network Egress).
  * Application-neutral (no inspection of application schemas).
  * Conservative and safe (dry-run deletion and imports by default).
  * Unprivileged (RunAsInvoker, user-mode execution).

