3. Third-Party Components & Dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------

session-checkpoint is designed with a Zero-Mandatory-Runtime-Dependencies
invariant. The entire core engine, SQLite persistence layer, JSON
canonicalization, cryptographic SHA-256 hashing, and CLI rely exclusively
on the Python Standard Library (PSF-2.0).

